Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.29,0:00:03.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.80,0:00:06.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're all dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.88,0:00:07.59,Note,0,0,0,0,,（忆往昔）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.59,0:00:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是想招募你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not trying to recruit you,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.00,0:00:11.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你需要知道 情况在变化\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you need to know, things are changing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.93,0:00:13.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你正好赶上任务报告\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're just in time for the briefing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.28,0:00:14.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 如果你想听听\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, that is if you wanna hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.68,0:00:18.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们打算怎么清除全美境内所有的吸血鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}how we're gonna exterminate every last vampire in America.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.02,0:00:19.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你总是中立\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're always playing the middle.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.19,0:00:21.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一次 你能不能选个立场\N{\fnArial\fs30}For once, why don't you pick a side?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.17,0:00:21.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,地狱猎犬\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hellhounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.95,0:00:23.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,把灵魂出卖给恶魔后\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, when you sell your soul to a demon,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.57,0:00:25.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们就会来把你的灵魂扯出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}they're the one that come and rip it out of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.13,0:00:27.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别动 - 你能控制它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stay! - You can control them?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.68,0:00:31.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你弄到这儿来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Getting you here…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.67,0:00:35.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我修改了咒语\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I managed to pervert that spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.10,0:00:38.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你的灵体没有被送回笼子\N{\fnArial\fs30}so your essence wasn't sent back to the Cage.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.56,0:00:40.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得这事会怎样结局\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you think this is going to end?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.62,0:00:43.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你被打败时 会措手不及\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not even gonna see it comin' when you get taken down.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.91,0:00:46.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就凭你 - 还有我的骨血\N{\fnArial\fs30}- By you? - And my flesh and blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.01,0:00:47.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你记得凯莉·克莱恩吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You remember Kelly Kline?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.69,0:00:51.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是个孩子 那是路西法的后代\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is not a baby. This is the spawn of Lucifer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.30,0:00:54.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯莉 天使 他们都想要你死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kelly, the angels? They want you dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.83,0:00:56.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我可以保护你\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I can protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.10,0:00:58.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我都不知道你的名字呢 - 大衮\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't even know your name. - Dagon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.13,0:01:01.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,始祖吸血鬼死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Alpha Vampire is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.51,0:01:03.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们在改变世界 我想加入进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're changing the world, and I wanna be a part of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.70,0:01:05.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我加入 - 你哥哥呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm in. - And your brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.52,0:01:08.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我点时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.79,0:01:11.14,Note,0,0,0,0,,（如今）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.09,0:01:18.34,Note,0,0,0,0,,（内布拉斯加州 谢里敦县）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.34,0:01:19.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.38,0:01:21.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 我们需要更多柴火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Babe, we're gonna need more wood.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.19,0:01:27.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 但首先 来看看这视频\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, but first, check out this video.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.91,0:01:29.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,这熊冲这些人发疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This bear goes crazy on these guys, and he j…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.91,0:01:32.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我们出来不是为了看视频的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, no. That's not why we come out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.61,0:01:35.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是来跟大自然沟通的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We come out here to commune with nature,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.26,0:01:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是来看人被大自然吞噬的\N{\fnArial\fs30}not watch people get eaten by it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.30,0:01:38.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 首先\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, first of all…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.94,0:01:40.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,它没吃了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}…he … he doesn't eat them.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.60,0:01:43.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,它把他们赶上了一棵树 他们哭了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He chases them up a tree, and they cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.21,0:01:45.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,哭得很惨\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.18,0:01:46.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,它想干吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do they want?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.67,0:01:48.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 超搞笑的 - 天呐 拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's hilarious. - Oh, my God. Please …
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.91,0:01:51.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,其次 「跟大自然沟通」\N{\fnArial\fs30}And second of all, "commune with nature"?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.41,0:01:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你带我出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you brought me out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.30,0:01:55.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,是为了脱光光 干奇怪的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}to get naked and do weird stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.59,0:01:58.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会那么奇怪的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it's not gonna get that weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.80,0:02:11.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会想念这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll miss this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.23,0:02:13.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会想念你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll miss you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.08,0:02:15.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.77,0:02:16.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,华盛顿有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, Washington has.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.92,0:02:19.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,最棒的兽医培训项目\N{\fnArial\fs30}the best veterinary program in the country.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.08,0:02:22.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你考进了 你必须去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got in. I mean, you have to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.91,0:02:26.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,但异地恋也有很多成功案例 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}But people make this long distance thing work all the time, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.50,0:02:30.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.66,0:02:38.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我再去弄点柴火来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna get more firewood.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.55,0:02:40.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.12,0:02:50.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你愿意嫁给我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you marry me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.79,0:02:54.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你愿意嫁给我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you marry me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.40,0:02:59.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,男人点 她会答应的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just man up. She'll say yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.24,0:03:41.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,格温 快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gwen! Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.44,0:03:43.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,马库斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marcus?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.05,0:03:47.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.37,0:04:15.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,[邪恶力量 第12季第15集]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.70,0:04:21.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,接二连三 真是可以载入史册\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back to back to back. That was one for the books.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.38,0:04:22.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是啊 - 天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - Man!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.59,0:04:24.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,老爸会喜欢这玩意的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad loved this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.18,0:04:26.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥们 那个…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, on the … on the …
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.46,0:04:27.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,别别…\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, don't, don't, don't, don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.38,0:04:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别坐 - 怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't s - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.71,0:04:32.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 你一身食尸鬼 还有死灵残骸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, you're covered in ghoul, man, and … and … and wraith.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.30,0:04:33.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.32,0:04:35.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你头发里还有一点海妖残骸\N{\fnArial\fs30}you have a piece of siren in your hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.52,0:04:44.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gross.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.94,0:04:45.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.03,0:04:50.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥们 你去冲个澡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, why don't you take a shower.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.17,0:04:51.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,换件衣服吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}and change your clothes?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.05,0:04:53.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你那内裤穿四天了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been wearing the same pair of boxers for four days.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.68,0:04:55.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 首先\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, one,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.30,0:04:58.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我带了几条内裤也太怪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}weird that you know how much underwear I packed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.18,0:05:00.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你就觉得这点怪 - 其次 是两天加两天\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's what's weird about this? - And B, it's two and two.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.94,0:05:02.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,翻过来穿不算同一条\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't count if you flip 'em inside out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.07,0:05:09.13,Note,0,0,0,0,,（弗罗多 内布拉斯加州 谢里敦县 失踪宿营者 现场一片狼藉）
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.14,0:05:10.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,又来案子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got another case.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.27,0:05:14.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吧 这么快 你怎么做到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really? Already? How'd you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.41,0:05:15.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟其他的一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same as the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.13,0:05:18.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做了个算法 筛选警用频道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I made a computer algorithm that scrapes data from police scanners,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.11,0:05:19.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,求救电话 本地新闻网站的数据\N{\fnArial\fs30}emergency calls, uh, local news sites,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.83,0:05:21.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后对一切进行…\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then it puts everything through a h…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.10,0:05:26.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,电脑告诉我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The computer told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.66,0:05:28.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,电脑啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Computers.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.46,0:05:30.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,怪物 黄片\N{\fnArial\fs30}Monsters, porn.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.95,0:05:32.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们还有什么做不到的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there anything they can't do?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.95,0:05:33.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.05,0:05:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那我们去吧 - 行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, let's get to it, then. - Yeah, that's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.00,0:05:38.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥们 你先收拾一下的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, dude, um… after you get cleaned up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.68,0:05:42.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 车里有湿巾 - 迪恩 我说真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I got baby wipes in the car. - Dude. Dean, I'm serious, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.68,0:05:44.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一身尸臭味儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}You smell like roadkill.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.48,0:05:48.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为累活儿都是我干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's 'cause I do all the heavy lifting.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.02,0:05:50.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你… - 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You - All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.22,0:05:52.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要用你一直藏着不让我用的梦幻洗发水\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm using that fancy shampoo you keep hidden from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.60,0:06:21.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗 太好了 妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, really? Oh, that's great, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.03,0:06:23.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 我们没事 - 听上去挺有希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, we're … we're fine. We, uh… - It sounds like somethin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.74,0:06:25.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗯 我也爱你 - 好 小卡 再联络\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. Love you, too. - All right, Cass. Let us know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.56,0:06:27.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好 再见 - 你先说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All right, bye. - You first.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.09,0:06:30.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈刚在亚克朗市摆平一只鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom just finished working a haunting in Akron.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.03,0:06:30.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 英国人吗 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The Brits? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.99,0:06:33.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,真好 找谁呢 混蛋捉鬼队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great. Who you gonna call? Douchebusters.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.35,0:06:35.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你呢 - 是小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What about you? - That was Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.35,0:06:39.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在爱达荷州科达伦 又有人在杀天使了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's in Coeur d'Alene, Idaho. Someone's killing angels. Again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.83,0:06:44.47,Note,0,0,0,0,,（餐厅服务员莎拉·达申斯基英年早逝 惨死在一个暴脾气外星人手下 餐厅经理赫伯·尼尔森如是说）
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.05,0:06:48.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 听上去不错 我这就给您拿水\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, sounds good. I'll get your waters right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.58,0:06:56.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 可以跟你们经理谈谈吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello. I'd like to speak to your manager, if I could.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.93,0:07:01.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是赫伯·尼尔森 这里的老板\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm, uh, Herb Nelson. I run this joint.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.84,0:07:03.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,幸会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pleasure to meet you,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.46,0:07:05.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,索兰奇探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agent…Solange.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.75,0:07:10.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来是为了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm, uh, I'm here about…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.17,0:07:12.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你为什么来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I-I-I know why you're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.36,0:07:15.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.20,0:07:17.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,悄悄的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quietly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.88,0:07:27.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.64,0:07:29.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个嘛…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.09,0:07:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.11,0:07:33.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心驶得万年船\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't be too careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.68,0:07:36.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们总在监视 窃听\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're always watching, listening.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.53,0:07:38.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.00,0:07:40.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 但这里是安全的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah. But we're safe in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.45,0:07:43.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,钢筋钢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reinforced steel.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.75,0:07:45.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁都别想进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing's gettin' through this sucker.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.43,0:07:47.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.19,0:07:56.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是为了莎拉来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, uh, you're here about Sara.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.55,0:07:59.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 你的服务员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, your waitress.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.24,0:08:01.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这篇文章中 你说\N{\fnArial\fs30}In this article, you said, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.56,0:08:03.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说她是被一个外星人杀死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}you said that she was killed by an alien.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.90,0:08:06.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是普通的外星人 爬行生物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, not just aliens. Reptilians.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.82,0:08:11.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像英国女王\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know… like the Queen of England.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.01,0:08:13.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.25,0:08:18.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这大有帮助 谢谢你的配合\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, well, that's very helpful. Thank you so much for your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.48,0:08:20.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有证据\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I-I got proof.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.68,0:08:23.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.07,0:08:25.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,看\N{\fnArial\fs30}See?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.91,0:08:28.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,大部分普通人受不了真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most sheeple can't handle the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.17,0:08:30.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我行 我是清醒的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But not me. I'm woke.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.25,0:08:32.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.83,0:08:35.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不用新技术\N{\fnArial\fs30}…why I don't use, uh, new tech.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.24,0:08:38.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,96年之后的东西 都是陷阱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything past '96, it's a trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.35,0:08:40.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,掌上电脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know…Palm Pilot.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.10,0:08:42.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,追踪设备还差不多 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's more like Tracking Device. Am I right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.10,0:08:45.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.60,0:08:46.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.94,0:08:48.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,看好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now watch this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.66,0:08:54.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.85,0:08:58.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道她是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, now I-I don't know who she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.81,0:09:00.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能也是个外星人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably another alien.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.61,0:09:04.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,她怀孕了 我赌是产仔皇后\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's preggers, so my money's on brood queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.28,0:09:08.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不知道他是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I don't know who he is either.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.39,0:09:10.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧 那是莎拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}There! That's Sara.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.55,0:09:13.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,看 银刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, look, look. See? Silver knives.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.82,0:09:16.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是外星金属\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's, uh, star metal.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.86,0:09:23.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 摄像头被烧坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, the … the camera got fried.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.98,0:09:26.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你看到了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you… you saw it, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.26,0:09:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在…\N{\fnArial\fs30}R-right…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.80,0:09:31.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}…there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.48,0:09:37.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她有 - 黄眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She has… - Yellow eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.80,0:09:40.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像我说的 是爬行生物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like I said … reptilian.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.43,0:09:42.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,本地警察 他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now the local cops, they…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.80,0:09:44.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们以为是…他们不相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}they think there's something … you know, they don't believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.33,0:09:46.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们以为是摄像头有问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}They think there's something weird with the camera.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.49,0:09:48.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,但…所以你才来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, I mean, that's why you're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.09,0:09:50.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,联调局 黑衣人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The … the FBI Man in Black.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.56,0:09:52.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,米色衣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you know, beige.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.18,0:09:54.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,要我说 是被熊抓了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ask me, a bear got him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.71,0:09:55.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能是美洲狮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe a cougar.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.01,0:09:59.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里有一滩血 那里还有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Found a fair amount of blood over here and some there,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.61,0:10:01.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}but no body.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.07,0:10:04.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能行凶的东西把他拖走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Figure whatever did this dragged him off.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.42,0:10:06.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非你们打算\N{\fnArial\fs30}So unless you guys are lookin' to.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.41,0:10:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,对动物立案\N{\fnArial\fs30}make a Federal case on some critters…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.00,0:10:10.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 你说有个生还者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, you said there was a survivor.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.97,0:10:12.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 格温·赫南德兹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Gwen Hernandez.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.81,0:10:14.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,但她吓得不轻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, but she's pretty shaken up,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.75,0:10:16.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,说了好多奇怪的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}saying all sorts of strange things.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.56,0:10:17.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like what?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.05,0:10:20.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如 他们是被狼袭击的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like that they were attacked by a wolf …
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.98,0:10:22.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,隐形的狼\N{\fnArial\fs30}an invisible wolf.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.16,0:10:25.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,姑娘说 那玩意突然冒出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Girl says that, you know, it came outta nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.16,0:10:27.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,还想袭击她\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that it's coming after her next.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.37,0:10:28.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,少来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.72,0:10:30.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,治安官 谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sheriff, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.16,0:10:37.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,隐形狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Invisible dog, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.62,0:10:40.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,听上去像地狱猎犬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds like a hellhound to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.87,0:10:41.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.41,0:10:48.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,格温 快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gwen! Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.92,0:10:50.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,马库斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marcus?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.12,0:10:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.70,0:11:13.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,这太蠢了 是个蠢主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is dumb. It's a dumb idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.62,0:11:15.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,格温看到什么东西杀了她男友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, Gwen saw something kill her boyfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.56,0:11:16.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,还觉得它接下来想袭击她\N{\fnArial\fs30}and she thinks it's coming for her next.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.98,0:11:18.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们得告诉她 - 告诉她什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We just gotta tell her - Tell her what?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.76,0:11:20.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的 萨姆 你打算说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, seriously, Sam, what are you gonna say?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.37,0:11:21.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,「你好 我是萨姆·温彻斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Hi, my name is Sam Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.54,0:11:24.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是比我帅得多的哥哥 迪恩 我们猎魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my much handsomer brother Dean. We hunt monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.84,0:11:25.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你搞的那个男的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, and that guy you were banging?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.76,0:11:27.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他应该是跟一个恶魔做了交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're pretty sure he made a deal with a demon,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.30,0:11:29.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以地狱猎犬跑来把他的灵魂拖入地狱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So a hellhound came and dragged his soul to Hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.10,0:11:29.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你呢 你没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you? You're cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.97,0:11:32.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然这里没有东西需要我们杀了 我们走了「\N{\fnArial\fs30}And since there's nothing around for us to kill, peace out."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.00,0:11:35.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,说完了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You done?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.55,0:11:36.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 我们不那么说 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we don't say that, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.56,0:11:38.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得说点能让她获得安宁\N{\fnArial\fs30}We say something that'll give her peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.80,0:11:40.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 让她晚上能入睡的话 - 那就撒谎呗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You know, help her sleep at night. - Oh, so we lie?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.52,0:11:42.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 弥天大谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.29,0:11:52.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,格温·赫南德兹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gwen Hernandez?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.07,0:11:54.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,联调局贝克和克莱普顿探员 可以进去吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agents Baker and Clapton. FBI. May we come in?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.80,0:11:57.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不… - 我们只想谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I…I don't want any… - We just wanna talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.39,0:11:59.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是谈谈马库斯的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all. About Marcus.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.32,0:12:09.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.16,0:12:18.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们坐吧 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You can have a seat. - Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.92,0:12:21.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,格温 我们今天来是因为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gwen, uh, we're here today because we, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.50,0:12:23.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们知道你对警察说了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}we know what you told the police,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.66,0:12:25.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得好像有\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you feel like something…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.94,0:12:27.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,超自然的东西要伤害你\N{\fnArial\fs30}supernatural is after you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.05,0:12:29.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们已经结束了调查\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we've concluded our investigation,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.04,0:12:31.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀死你男友的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the thing that killed your boyfriend …
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.46,0:12:32.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,是只熊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was a bear.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.23,0:12:35.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,是只熊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was a bear.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.49,0:12:38.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们找到了它 也杀掉它了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now we found it and put it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.91,0:12:42.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经没有危险了 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you're no longer in any kind of danger, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.56,0:12:47.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.89,0:12:50.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我看到了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I know what I saw.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.96,0:12:54.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,格温 你经历创伤时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gwen, when you go through a traumatic experience,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.98,0:12:57.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时候你的大脑会编造记忆\N{\fnArial\fs30}sometimes your mind can make things up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.23,0:12:59.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 出去 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get out. - Sorry?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.14,0:13:01.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,滚出我家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of my house.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.55,0:13:03.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 冷静 我们只是想帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, calm down. We're just trying to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.29,0:13:04.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不需要你们帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.68,0:13:07.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我看到了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what I saw.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.52,0:13:09.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 格温 - 出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Gwen… - Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.90,0:13:13.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.22,0:13:27.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 她会睡得香又甜的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah. She's gonna sleep like a baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.26,0:14:39.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事 你不会有事的 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}It's okay. You're gonna be okay. All right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.75,0:14:46.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定让你很不爽吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It must really burn you,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.23,0:14:49.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道是我把你关进了这座监狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}knowing I'm the one who put you in this prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.46,0:14:55.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.59,0:14:59.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I own you,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.66,0:15:02.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为我们做了很多计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I have big plans for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.44,0:15:05.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我好荣幸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm flattered.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.63,0:15:08.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,如此费心\N{\fnArial\fs30}All this hard work,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.54,0:15:09.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么…\N{\fnArial\fs30}all that…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.35,0:15:12.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他们颤抖 猛汉\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get 'em, slugger!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.13,0:15:15.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是要剥了你的皮 吃了你的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm still gonna peel off your skin and eat your soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.89,0:15:17.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是吗 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is that so? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.67,0:15:24.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,会弄得比较…乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, it will be… little bit messy,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.18,0:15:25.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.67,0:15:28.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,总得维护名声嘛 你理解的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, gotta protect the rep. You understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.21,0:15:31.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我理解 但就凭你 还铐着那锁链\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do. But you, in … in those chains?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.47,0:15:34.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,原谅我没有吓得发抖\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, forgive me if I'm not quaking in my Testonis.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.15,0:15:37.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得我们都明白 这\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I think both you and I understand that this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.30,0:15:40.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是暂时的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just a temporary situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.76,0:15:42.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, do we?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.63,0:15:44.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.43,0:15:47.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管你有什么可悲的小阴谋\N{\fnArial\fs30}that whatever sad little scheme that you're brewing up,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.16,0:15:50.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都先你十步了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm already 10 steps ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.92,0:15:52.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还以为自傲是我的罪孽呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I thought pride was my sin.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.62,0:15:56.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是自傲 是事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not pride. It's fact.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.33,0:15:59.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你惹我 我碾压你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You cross me, I crush you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.30,0:16:02.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打我 我用双倍力气奉还\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hit me, I hit you back twice as hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.30,0:16:06.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你让我做你的狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You make me your dog,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.77,0:16:08.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我让你做我的奴\N{\fnArial\fs30}I make you my slave.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.13,0:16:18.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.40,0:16:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,克劳力 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley. My lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.37,0:16:23.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}My lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.29,0:16:25.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人找\N{\fnArial\fs30}Duty calls.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.15,0:16:31.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心我 我就坐这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry about me. I'll just sit right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.74,0:16:41.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, you will.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.36,0:16:44.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,重口\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kinky.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.79,0:16:54.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.96,0:16:57.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 陛下 就是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apologies, Your Excellence. It's just, um…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.08,0:16:59.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,周会您已经迟到一小时了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're already an hour late for the weekly meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.70,0:17:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,上周我们就延迟了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we had to push last week, so…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.90,0:17:03.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,您有410项十字路口交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have 410 crossroad deals.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.98,0:17:05.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要高级管理层批准\N{\fnArial\fs30}that need senior management approval,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.72,0:17:08.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有638件其他事宜\N{\fnArial\fs30}on top of the 638 other matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.21,0:17:11.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要您马上处理\N{\fnArial\fs30}that require your immediate response.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.81,0:17:14.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.17,0:17:17.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,格温\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gwen, that, um,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.66,0:17:20.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,那玩意 是只地狱猎犬\N{\fnArial\fs30}that thing was a hellhound.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.42,0:17:22.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}A…what?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.79,0:17:23.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,地狱猎犬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hellhound.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.00,0:17:25.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,挺难解释的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kind of hard to explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.55,0:17:28.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,简单说 就是地狱的巨大隐形猎犬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Basically, giant, invisible hounds from Hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.67,0:17:31.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不难嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wasn't hard at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.69,0:17:36.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不是警察 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you guys are not cops, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.72,0:17:39.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 并不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Not exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.17,0:17:42.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫萨姆 他是我哥哥 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is Sam. That's my brother Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.77,0:17:44.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们猎魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we hunt monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.10,0:17:47.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们以前接触过地狱猎犬\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we've tangled with hellhounds in the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.90,0:17:49.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,巫尘能挡住它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goofer dust'll keep 'em out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.51,0:17:52.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶魔刀或天使刃能杀死它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}A demon knife or an angel blade, that'll kill 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.83,0:17:58.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.12,0:18:01.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你们为什么对我说马库斯是熊杀的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So why did you tell me that Marcus got killed by a bear?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.41,0:18:03.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了让你好受点 是他的主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make you feel better. It was his idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.11,0:18:09.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我知道这听上去很疯狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, I know this sounds insane …
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.64,0:18:10.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}It does.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.85,0:18:14.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 我说了 我知道我看到了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}But…like I said, I know what I saw.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.33,0:18:17.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到的就是疯狂的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what I saw was insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.44,0:18:18.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.71,0:18:21.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这有点尴尬 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now this is awkward, but, um…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.65,0:18:27.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,地狱猎犬只会来抓把灵魂卖给了\N{\fnArial\fs30}hellhounds only come after people who sold their souls…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.60,0:18:28.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶魔的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}to a demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.72,0:18:33.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么10年前 你有没有特别想要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So about 10 years ago, did you really want something?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.98,0:18:36.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如…凯蒂猫背包\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like…I don't know, a Hello Kitty backpack.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.92,0:18:38.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者宿敌死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}or the death of an enemy?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.07,0:18:40.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.55,0:18:44.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,马库斯呢 他有…\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about Marcus? Did he… Would he …
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.32,0:18:45.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.77,0:18:53.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了 那怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great. So what the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.60,0:18:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.47,0:18:57.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我知道该问谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I do know who we can ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.52,0:19:06.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,接下来 41号案件 阿瓦 一个三级恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}And moving on to, um, case 41, Awar, a Rank Three demon,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.10,0:19:08.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,称他抓了六个孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}claims to have had six babies.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.12,0:19:09.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,但莫莱克斯 一个二级恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}But then Morax, a Rank Two demon,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.88,0:19:12.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,夺走了他两个孩子 阿瓦就只剩…\N{\fnArial\fs30}took two of his babies, which would leave Awar with…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.49,0:19:14.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 四个孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}yes, um, four babies.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.02,0:19:17.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得我们都可以认同 这数目\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which I think we can all agree, isn't enough babies…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.90,0:19:19.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,完全不够好好吃一顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}for a decent meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.65,0:19:23.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 阿瓦寻求赔偿\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, not at all. Um, Awar is looking for compensation.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.66,0:19:25.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 形式是 - 我不在乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}- in the form of - I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.78,0:19:26.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续\N{\fnArial\fs30}Moving on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.92,0:19:30.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是 继续说42号案件\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me either. Uh, moving on to case 42.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.79,0:19:32.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个挺好 是关于侵权法改革的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a good one. It's on tort reform.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.89,0:19:33.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.52,0:19:46.37,Note,0,0,0,0,,（不是小鹿 来电）
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.58,0:19:49.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.88,0:19:51.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 桃子 我知道你还在气\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, Peaches, I get that you're still upset about.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.81,0:19:53.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那件… - 气\N{\fnArial\fs30}- the whole, uh… - Upset?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.00,0:19:57.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我已经完全忘了你和你们那群怪胎\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm totally over how you and your little band of misfits.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.97,0:20:01.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,送我儿子回到过去等死的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}sent my son back in time… to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.57,0:20:06.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 那是加文的决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, look, that was totally Gavin's call.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.59,0:20:09.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗 我们这里有点状况\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right? You know what? We have a situation here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.43,0:20:12.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么…再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, well, in that case…Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.56,0:20:13.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,地狱猎犬 克劳力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hellhounds, Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.44,0:20:15.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的一只恶犬在杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of your mutts is going after folks.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.98,0:20:18.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没有出卖灵魂的人 - 不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}- who didn't sell their souls. - Not possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.68,0:20:19.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.21,0:20:23.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的猎犬\N{\fnArial\fs30}My hounds…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.25,0:20:25.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么关于它们的事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have anything to tell me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.79,0:20:28.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.52,0:20:31.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们…\N{\fnArial\fs30}We, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.13,0:20:32.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,本不想打扰您\N{\fnArial\fs30}didn't wanna bother you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.72,0:20:34.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,是拉姆齐\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was Ramsey.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.48,0:20:38.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,它跑出去了 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}She got out, my lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.24,0:20:42.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,处死犬舍守卫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have the kennel guards killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.85,0:20:43.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,死得痛苦点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Painfully.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.16,0:20:48.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.02,0:20:49.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,到\N{\fnArial\fs30}here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.53,0:20:57.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,想我了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You miss me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.68,0:21:03.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,适合外出的好天气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice day out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.56,0:21:06.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.71,0:21:08.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kelvin.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.63,0:21:11.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还记得 我们只见过一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you remember? We only met the once, so…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.24,0:21:12.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这儿做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.59,0:21:14.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟你的目的一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same reason as you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.21,0:21:15.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,找凯莉·克莱恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Track down Kelly Kline.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.14,0:21:17.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,和她肚子里的那个魔鬼之子\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that unholy bun she's got in her oven.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.20,0:21:21.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们互帮互助一下如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what do you say we help each other out?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.64,0:21:24.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to understand,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.16,0:21:26.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是普通的地狱猎犬\N{\fnArial\fs30}this isn't just a hellhound.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.39,0:21:28.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,是最厉害的地狱猎犬\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the hellhound.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.20,0:21:29.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}That means what?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.51,0:21:31.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝说完「要有光」后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right after God said, "Let there be light, "
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.94,0:21:34.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还创造了一堆其他东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}he … he made a whole bunch of things …
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.40,0:21:36.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,花束 考拉 地狱猎犬\N{\fnArial\fs30}posies, koalas, hellhounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.93,0:21:38.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想要个造物主最好的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wanted The Creator's best friend,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.69,0:21:40.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,但猎犬太凶残\N{\fnArial\fs30}but the hounds were too vicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.94,0:21:42.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以他就打算把它们都杀掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}So he planned on having them all put down,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.57,0:21:47.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到 我们最喜欢的坠落天使出现了\N{\fnArial\fs30}until along came our favorite fallen angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.02,0:21:51.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他救走了一只猎犬 一只怀孕的母狗 拉姆齐\N{\fnArial\fs30}He rescued one of the hounds … a pregnant bitch named Ramsey.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.11,0:21:52.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么不能叫它乖乖听话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you just tell her to heel?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.35,0:21:54.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我控制不了它 没人能\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't control her. No one can.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.84,0:21:57.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,它只忠于路西法\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's loyal only to Lucifer.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.13,0:22:00.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 魔鬼吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, like the Devil?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.78,0:22:02.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 但他关在笼子里呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but he's locked in a cage.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.30,0:22:05.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那就好 - 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good.- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.76,0:22:08.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 那狗狗现在在哪呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, so where is Fido now?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.38,0:22:10.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,要我猜 应该是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if I had to hazard a guess, I would say.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.57,0:22:13.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,躲在哪个暖和舒适的窝里\N{\fnArial\fs30}huddled up in some nice, warm den.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.52,0:22:15.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,它为什么要针对格温\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, why is she after Gwen?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.54,0:22:16.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,问她啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ask her.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.81,0:22:18.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.68,0:22:20.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.03,0:22:26.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,它袭击我们时 我还击了它\N{\fnArial\fs30}When it attacked us, I did hit it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.13,0:22:29.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,用斧子\N{\fnArial\fs30}With an ax.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.85,0:22:33.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就对了 那母狗就喜欢记仇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, there you go. The bitch does tend to hold a grudge.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.92,0:22:36.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要么杀了拉姆齐\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we either kill Ramsey,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.50,0:22:38.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,要么让猎犬吃了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}or the hound eats her.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.81,0:22:40.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,有趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.80,0:22:42.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.79,0:22:43.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,「我们」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"We"?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.19,0:22:46.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,那样的狗狗到处乱跑会损害生意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pup like that out and about is not good for business.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.41,0:22:48.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,会让人们觉得我不能控制局面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Makes it look like I'm not in control.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.36,0:22:51.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 把那只狗的头挂在我的墙上\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that mutt's head mounted on my wall?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.43,0:22:54.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是好广告了 是的 小鹿 我们一起行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good for the brand. So yes, Moose, for now, "We."
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.65,0:22:57.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了 现在有只一心寻仇的地狱猎犬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great. So we have a hellhound who's gunning for revenge,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.23,0:22:58.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是私仇\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it's personal.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.26,0:23:01.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还以为这行不会更奇怪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just when I thought this gig couldn't get any weirder…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.67,0:23:04.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,总能更奇怪的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It can always get weirder.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.14,0:23:24.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.17,0:23:27.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.90,0:23:41.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}My lord…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.14,0:23:43.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不配\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not worthy!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.15,0:23:48.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就知道克劳力在搞什么鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}We knew Crowley was up to something.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.37,0:23:50.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的那副表现\N{\fnArial\fs30}The way he's been acting?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.23,0:23:53.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且他还杀了所有参与笼子项目的恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}And how he snuffed out everyone who was part of the Cage project?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.03,0:23:55.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们很多人真的不喜欢克劳力\N{\fnArial\fs30}And a lot of us really don't like Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.64,0:23:57.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,他太咋呼了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's very prancy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.34,0:24:01.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们放了你的猎犬 分他的神\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we released your hound to create a distraction,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.12,0:24:03.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,想看看他藏了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}to see what he was hiding. ‭
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.95,0:24:05.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们 - 我们希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We - ‭We hoped …
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.60,0:24:07.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们知道肯定是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We knew it could only be you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.04,0:24:12.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们带来了这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we brought this.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.63,0:24:24.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But … but… ‭
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.70,0:24:30.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们放了你之前 我们有几件\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before we, uh, let you out, we have a few…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.08,0:24:33.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不算是要求了\N{\fnArial\fs30}well, I wouldn't call them demands, exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.19,0:24:35.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.11,0:24:42.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,地狱猎犬人类看不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}So hellhounds are invisible to humans…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.76,0:24:46.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非你卖了灵魂 它们来抓你\N{\fnArial\fs30}unless you sold your soul, and they're after you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.49,0:24:48.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,或是 戴上这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or, uh, you're wearing a pair of these.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.75,0:24:51.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是用圣油炼过的眼镜\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're glasses treated with holy fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.95,0:24:53.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 克劳力和我进树林\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, Crowley and I are gonna hit the woods,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.74,0:24:55.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,看能不能找到魔犬\N{\fnArial\fs30}see if we can't track down Cujo.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.54,0:24:57.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟着萨姆 他会保护你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stick with Sam. He'll keep you safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.79,0:24:58.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.09,0:25:02.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,照顾好她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take care of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.45,0:25:03.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.41,0:25:05.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 就算拉姆齐回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, look, even if Ramsey circles back,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.90,0:25:09.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要我们保持移动 格温就…\N{\fnArial\fs30}as long as we keep moving, Gwen's gonna be just…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.68,0:25:12.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是指车\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're talking about the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.73,0:25:14.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你总是狠踩刹车 - 迪恩 我会开车\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You tend to ride the brakes. - Dean, I know how to drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.99,0:25:16.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是说说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.51,0:25:18.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,把她想成\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, just imagine she's a…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.80,0:25:20.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个美女\N{\fnArial\fs30}a beautiful woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.03,0:25:21.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不理你了 - 一个非常美丽的女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on. Get out of here. - A beautiful, beautiful woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.53,0:25:23.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 受不了你 - 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm done. - ‭Sam…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.94,0:25:31.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.85,0:25:37.35,Note,0,0,0,0,,（内布拉斯加州 谢里敦县 席卡谷）
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.12,0:25:44.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,天堂近况如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}So how are things in Heaven?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.11,0:25:46.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,还算正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}Functional.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.69,0:25:49.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是照常有内斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, there's the usual infighting, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.21,0:25:52.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是路西法要有孩子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}let's just say Lucifer having a baby on board has.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.19,0:25:53.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们团结了起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}brought us all together.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.80,0:25:59.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是全员出动的情况 卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, this is an all hands on deck situation, Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.70,0:26:01.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,包括你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Including yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.85,0:26:03.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是来找我帮忙的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so you're here for my hands?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.48,0:26:05.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We want you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.20,0:26:07.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的外勤经验\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, you got more field experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.52,0:26:09.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,比一千个天使加起来都多\N{\fnArial\fs30}than the next thousand angels combined.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.83,0:26:11.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得你高估我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you overestimate me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.95,0:26:13.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.38,0:26:16.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你在跟温家兄弟合作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I know you're working with the Winchesters.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.84,0:26:18.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆和迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam and Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.73,0:26:20.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的心意是好的 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}their hearts are in the right place, but.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.85,0:26:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,有我们做后援不是更好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}wouldn't it be better to have us waiting in the proverbial wings?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.14,0:26:26.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,有全天堂的力量支持你\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the power of Heaven behind you?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.85,0:26:33.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会怀念吗 楼上的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ever miss it? Upstairs?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.13,0:26:36.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,别误会 我喜欢地球 很古怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, don't get me wrong. I love Earth. It's quirky.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.66,0:26:37.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,一股干草味儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}It smells like hay.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.87,0:26:41.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这里不是家 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's not home, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.79,0:26:47.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不相信天堂欢迎我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't believe I'm welcome in Heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.37,0:26:48.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.78,0:26:50.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们还在记你的仇\N{\fnArial\fs30}They still hold a lot of grudges up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.65,0:26:54.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,但如果我说 你可以回来呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what if I told you, you could come back?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.93,0:26:58.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的一切罪孽都可以被忘记\N{\fnArial\fs30}That all your sins could be forgotten?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.30,0:27:00.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,被原谅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forgiven?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.16,0:27:01.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会说你在撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would say that you're lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.75,0:27:03.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, but I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.02,0:27:05.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你帮我们找到凯莉·克莱恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You help us track down Kelly Kline,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.88,0:27:08.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,天堂就欢迎你回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you will be welcomed back into the fold.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.51,0:27:11.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,是嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.17,0:27:13.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有权那么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you have the power to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.03,0:27:16.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 我只是传个信儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, I can't. I'm just the messenger.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.07,0:27:19.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,但约书亚有权\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Joshua can.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.16,0:27:25.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,约书亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Joshua.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.84,0:27:29.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为他让位了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought he stepped aside.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.42,0:27:30.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He did.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.44,0:27:34.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我说了 这是全员出动的情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}But like I said, all hands on deck situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.24,0:27:37.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,想想看 卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Imagine it, Castiel …
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.26,0:27:40.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以随意来去\N{\fnArial\fs30}free to come and go as you please,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.09,0:27:42.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,成为家庭一员\N{\fnArial\fs30}part of your family,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.53,0:27:44.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,再次回归你真正的家庭\N{\fnArial\fs30}your true family, again.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.17,0:27:50.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.84,0:27:52.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,那位园丁有个计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Gardener's got a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.81,0:27:55.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只求你听听我们说\N{\fnArial\fs30}All we ask is that you hear us,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.04,0:27:57.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,听他说完\N{\fnArial\fs30}hear him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.89,0:28:02.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了大局\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the greater good.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.68,0:28:07.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. ‭
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.96,0:28:09.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后\N{\fnArial\fs30}and lastly…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.52,0:28:13.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你每年要给我一千个灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will grant me a thousand souls per year,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.51,0:28:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要封我为\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you will anoint me…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.83,0:28:20.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,新十字路口之王\N{\fnArial\fs30}the new King of the Crossroads.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.05,0:28:24.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great. ‭
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.36,0:28:26.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,汤米 你还想要什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Tommy, you want anything, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.77,0:28:30.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我唯一的心愿就是重振地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only thing I care about is making Hell great again.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.80,0:28:32.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧\N{\fnArial\fs30}See?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.86,0:28:34.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.10,0:28:41.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我们来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.70,0:28:45.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}There we go, my lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.55,0:28:59.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我感觉好棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.16,0:29:05.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们说好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We had a deal!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.25,0:29:06.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did we?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.09,0:29:17.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 孩子 你理解的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, kid. You understand, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.63,0:29:19.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能留活口什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No … no witnesses or anything, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.91,0:29:21.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 杀了我吧 堕落者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Take me, oh, Fallen One!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.65,0:29:23.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的生命随你吞噬\N{\fnArial\fs30}My life is yours to devour.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.14,0:29:27.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧 你这么一说就奇怪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, now you just made it weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.32,0:29:44.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,真漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}Fancy.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.84,0:29:46.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,很凸显你眼睛的魅力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really bring out your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.37,0:29:48.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 闭嘴 - 闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Shut up. - Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.15,0:29:50.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我说真的 克劳力 - 我说真的 克劳力\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I mean it, Crowley. - I mean it, Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.15,0:29:52.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 下地狱吧 - 下地狱吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Go to Hell. - ‭Go to Hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.03,0:29:58.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的 迪恩 这么多年了 你太好猜了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really, Dean, all these years, you're so predictable.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.10,0:30:00.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我们都变了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, I guess we've all changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.40,0:30:03.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我变得好猜了 你变心软了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got predictable. You got soft.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.15,0:30:04.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,几年前 谁能想到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, a few years ago, who'd have thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.20,0:30:06.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会帮我们救个姑娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}you'd be helping us save the girl of the week?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.38,0:30:07.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不在乎她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care about her.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.32,0:30:10.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许我们影响了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, maybe we rubbed off on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.23,0:30:11.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,少臭美了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't flatter yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.31,0:30:13.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你救了小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}You save Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.02,0:30:16.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是不想看到温家男人伤春悲秋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just to spare myself the Winchester Man Pain …
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.74,0:30:19.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你俩像两个小女生一样哭哭啼啼\N{\fnArial\fs30}you lot moping about like a bunch of schoolgirls.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.43,0:30:21.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想说 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just wanna say thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.30,0:30:23.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有 几年前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or…A few years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.18,0:30:26.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁能想到你会跟地狱之王合作\N{\fnArial\fs30}who would've thought you'd be working with the King of Hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.08,0:30:28.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许是我影响了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you've rubbed off on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.48,0:30:33.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许 我的影响蹭了你一身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe I've rubbed off all over you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.02,0:30:48.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.02,0:30:51.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.77,0:30:52.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,这事\N{\fnArial\fs30}This.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.31,0:30:54.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,都怪我\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.43,0:30:58.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 格温 这不怪你 - 就怪我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Gwen, this is not your fault. - Yes, it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.91,0:31:00.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,马库斯的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened to Marcus…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.06,0:31:02.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,格温 快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gwen! Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.78,0:31:09.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,停车 求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pull over. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.11,0:31:10.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.73,0:31:18.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,*我们去打猎*\N{\fnArial\fs30}*A hunting we will go*
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.06,0:31:21.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,*我们去打猎*\N{\fnArial\fs30}*A hunting we will go*
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.36,0:31:23.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,克劳力 闭嘴 不开玩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley, shut up. Seriously. ‭
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.66,0:31:43.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉姆齐把他拖了回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ramsey dragged him back…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.54,0:31:44.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,回了它的窝\N{\fnArial\fs30}to her den.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.79,0:31:47.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,是空的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.25,0:31:49.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,它在哪呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}So where is she now?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.92,0:31:57.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}‭You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.10,0:32:01.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.72,0:32:04.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得我已经不知道那是什么意思了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think I even know what "Okay" means anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.18,0:32:10.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,马库斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marcus…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.43,0:32:13.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,去宿营是我提出的\N{\fnArial\fs30}going camping was my idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.79,0:32:17.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我带他去宿营 其实我心里知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I took him out there even though I knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.22,0:32:20.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我们结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew it was over.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.36,0:32:27.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢马库斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I liked Marcus.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.91,0:32:30.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,他很温柔 贴心\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was sweet and kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.45,0:32:32.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,他爱我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he loved me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.57,0:32:39.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对他的爱远不及他对我 远不及…\N{\fnArial\fs30}More than I ever loved him. More than…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.81,0:32:45.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我告诉了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I'd just told him… If I…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.49,0:32:48.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为什么不告诉他真话呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why couldn't I just tell him the truth?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.92,0:32:54.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 格温 - 但我没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Gwen… - ‭Yeah, but I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.96,0:32:56.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我撒谎了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I lied.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.17,0:32:59.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我撒谎 好简化事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}I lied to make things easier. I…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.86,0:33:12.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. I…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.60,0:33:14.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们该走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should go.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.19,0:33:20.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.52,0:33:24.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}‭What?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.38,0:33:25.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,它来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.63,0:33:34.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的 保持冷静\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay. It's okay. Stay calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.43,0:33:39.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 天呐 - 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, my God. - ‭All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.11,0:33:52.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们该走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.06,0:33:54.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不 格温 我得解决它\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, Gwen, I gotta take care of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.87,0:33:56.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则它不会停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the only way she'll stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.03,0:34:01.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,待在车里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay in the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.86,0:34:03.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 待在车里 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stay in the car! - ‭Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.97,0:35:04.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以说你不能开车\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}This is why you don't drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.01,0:35:07.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,那…结束了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…it's over?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.33,0:35:09.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.59,0:35:11.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.86,0:35:12.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.50,0:35:18.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,狗死了 我得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dog dead. Must be going.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.87,0:35:20.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,克劳力 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Crowley, wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.95,0:35:26.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.87,0:35:38.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他看上去挺好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He seems nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.10,0:35:39.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.06,0:35:47.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,上车吧 希望它还能跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get in. Hopefully, it still runs.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.95,0:36:00.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你之前说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now what was that you were saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.65,0:36:04.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,总先我两步的\N{\fnArial\fs30}about always being two steps ahead?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.46,0:36:25.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见 克劳力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buh-bye, Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.12,0:36:29.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是那么说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not what I said.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.86,0:36:34.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the… ‭
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.47,0:36:40.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很高兴你尝到了一点自由的滋味\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm glad you had a little taste of freedom.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.67,0:36:43.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I said was,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.72,0:36:46.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我总是先你十步\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm always 10 steps ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.71,0:36:48.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说你惹我 我碾压你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said you cross me, I crush you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.91,0:36:50.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hit me…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.85,0:36:52.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我用双倍力气奉还\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hit you back twice as hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.48,0:36:55.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你让我做你的狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You make me your dog,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.91,0:36:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我让你做我的奴\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll make you my slave.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.66,0:37:11.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你脖子上的铁链\N{\fnArial\fs30}That chain around your neck?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.24,0:37:15.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,根本不算什么 时髦的装饰品而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was nothing. A stylish accessory.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.57,0:37:17.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这具皮囊\N{\fnArial\fs30}This vessel…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.23,0:37:20.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,才是你真正的监牢\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's your true prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.81,0:37:24.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,用笼子的符文和咒语做了防护\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been warded with runes and spellwork from the Cage,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.77,0:37:27.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,刻入了每个分子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}carved into every molecule.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.42,0:37:29.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}‭In there?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.33,0:37:32.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I own you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.18,0:37:38.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这才刚开始 所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just getting started. So…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.66,0:37:40.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要把你关回你的洞里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna put you back in your hole,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.06,0:37:41.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我要找到你的后裔\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then I'm gonna go find your spawn,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.84,0:37:44.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要让你看着我把他撕成碎片\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'm gonna rip him apart while you watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.63,0:37:46.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.98,0:37:57.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是才刚开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm still just getting started.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.97,0:38:03.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡 什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass, what's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.42,0:38:05.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可能有凯莉·克莱恩的线索了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I have a lead on Kelly Kline.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.39,0:38:06.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.76,0:38:08.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,她跟地狱王子大衮在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's with Dagon, Prince of Hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.84,0:38:10.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我们对他有什么了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, what do we know about him?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.37,0:38:11.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实 是她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, it's a her.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.39,0:38:15.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,了解不多 只有些传闻和故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}And not much. It's just rumors and stories.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.61,0:38:18.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,大衮最出名的是她疯子一般的残忍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dagon is mostly known for her psychotic savagery.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.15,0:38:21.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了 凯莉呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great. So where's Kelly?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.84,0:38:24.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,她原本在爱达荷州 科达伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was in Coeur d'Alene, Idaho.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.87,0:38:27.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 我不确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now? I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.63,0:38:29.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我们会把消息传出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, well, we'll spread the word.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.61,0:38:31.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,有发现告诉我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let us know if you find anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.32,0:38:32.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.31,0:38:36.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好了吗 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ready, brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.94,0:38:49.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他听上去有没有怪怪的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He sound weird to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.73,0:38:53.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的电脑又说话了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that your computer talking to you again?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.75,0:38:56.22,Note,0,0,0,0,,（弗罗多来电）
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.85,0:39:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.36,0:39:04.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,是\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.09,0:39:06.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,米克·戴维斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mick Davies.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.61,0:39:08.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - ‭Dean…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.88,0:39:12.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有电脑程序给我找案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have a computer program feeding me cases.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.62,0:39:14.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.92,0:39:19.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,格温 这两周我们所有的案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gwen? Every job we've worked in the last two weeks?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.27,0:39:22.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,都来自英国记录者\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've come from the British Men of Letters.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.12,0:39:26.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是吗 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Really? - ‭Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.24,0:39:28.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没说是因为我知道你多恨他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't tell you 'cause I know how much you hate them.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.79,0:39:31.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我们恨他们 我们都恨他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we hate them. Us. Together.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.12,0:39:33.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 真的 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I get that. Yeah, I do. But … but…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.30,0:39:36.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 多亏米克和他的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, because of Mick and his guys,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.82,0:39:38.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,吸血鬼始祖死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Alpha Vampire is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.81,0:39:41.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们有成果\N{\fnArial\fs30}They get results.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.51,0:39:43.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不想跟他们合作 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't like them either, but … but if …
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.02,0:39:45.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们能救人 那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}if we can save people, then it…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.57,0:39:55.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管怎样 我不该瞒你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Either way, I-I shouldn't have lied to you. And…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.43,0:39:58.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, man. I-I…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.22,0:40:03.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.75,0:40:05.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.35,0:40:09.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还能说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want me to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.85,0:40:11.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢这样吗 不喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do I like it? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.69,0:40:14.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我信任他们吗 绝不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do I trust them? Hell, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.40,0:40:18.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.06,0:40:24.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们经常跟我们不信任的人合作\N{\fnArial\fs30}We work with people we don't trust all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.50,0:40:26.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还刚克劳力联手了呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, hell, I just Liam Neeson'd it up with Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.62,0:40:31.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你想试试看 那\N{\fnArial\fs30}So if you wanna give this a shot, then…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.95,0:40:35.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.03,0:40:39.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 一旦\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the minute … and I mean the second …
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.74,0:40:41.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们感到不对劲 我们就撤\N{\fnArial\fs30}something feels off, we bail.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.24,0:40:43.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Of course. Deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.35,0:40:52.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,是米克\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Mick.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.87,0:40:57.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,接吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pick it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.22,0:41:05.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Sam.
